  "details": "I am using Udonsharp's [DefaultExecutionOrder] to create a gimmick that controls the initialization order between Udonsharp.\n\nIt has been working as expected so far with the live client.\n\nIf I switch only the VRchat client from live to persistence-beta without changing anything in the world, the Udonsharp will not be executed in the expected order, the initialization will fail and the gimmick will not work.\n\nConfirmed world: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_afed00d2-7078-4e28-a327-c813aade3fc5\n\nSorry, this is not the minimum configuration, but I can confirm that switching clients will not allow you to “get into” the gimmick you have in place.",
